        "url": "/api/v2/version/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "LUNATONE becomes active around the\ntime of the full moon. Instead of\nwalking, it moves by floating in midair.\fThe POKéMON’s intimidating red eyes\ncause all those who see it to become\ntransfixed with fear.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
